        "prose": "August brought in $488,485, a little less than July's $493,831, and the quietest month since May. It sits well below June's $787,057, the highest month of the year. Orders fell to 598 from 652 in July, while the average order rose to $816.86 from $757.41. Across the twelve months the order count ran from 460 in February 2026 to 759 in December 2025.",
