        "prose": "North America brought in $2,462,367 over the last twelve months, 40.6% of revenue, followed by Europe at $1,689,183. Asia Pacific is third at $821,988, and Africa the smallest named region at $146,671. The web carried 4,308 orders and $3,548,710, 58.4% of the total, while phone orders brought in $1,712,924 and partners $810,338.",
